 "note": "Each presentation is an intake-shaped record: a candidate entry plus the provenance facts intake assembles for each cited source (produced_by, attributed_to, kind, lineage, presented_as, independence_asserted). Historical fixtures reconstruct the six historical instances of record from the GR-088-01 / GR-088-11 / GR-088-16 / GR-088-29 family; each carries its record citation. Planted fixtures are minimal synthetic presentations, one per shape, built to trip exactly that shape. Negative fixtures are legitimate presentations that resemble the shapes and must not be flagged. Derivation alone is never flagged; every detector keys on the mislabelling."
